{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603650/extras/steamdesc.png?t=1745353331\" />Cubic Blitz is an isometric puzzle game with over 50 hand-crafted levels. You control a cube, whose goal is to paint the blank tiles of each level according to specific pre-defined colors. You can toggle between viewing the end goal colors and the colors you currently have on the board. There are a multitude of special tiles and changes in the world that will help and hinder you, such as sponges, rain, and even teleporters!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels have a gradual increase in difficulty that allow the player to grow accustomed to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no time limit - play levels at your own speed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The controls and movement are straightforward, while also providing levels of depth to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is tracked in each level, offering replayability to beat your previous time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels will test your wits and creativity. Will you be able to overcome the challenges laid out before you and achieve victory?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603650?t=1745353331","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603650?t=1745353331","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603650/f005836b8d65f07d0ab7ed7d2dff0f6edaed8fc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745353331","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603650/f005836b8d65f07d0ab7ed7d2dff0f6edaed8fc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745353331","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3631550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603650/extras/steamdesc.png?t=1745353331\" />Cubic Blitz is an isometric puzzle game with over 50 hand-crafted levels. You control a cube, whose goal is to paint the blank tiles of each level according to specific pre-defined colors. You can toggle between viewing the end goal colors and the colors you currently have on the board. There are a multitude of special tiles and changes in the world that will help and hinder you, such as sponges, rain, and even teleporters!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels have a gradual increase in difficulty that allow the player to grow accustomed to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no time limit - play levels at your own speed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The controls and movement are straightforward, while also providing levels of depth to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is tracked in each level, offering replayability to beat your previous time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels will test your wits and creativity. Will you be able to overcome the challenges laid out before you and achieve victory?</p>","developers":["Pinprick Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603650/9b5b717e433b70f65d9f323fe0c920b38e9d79bd/header.jpg?t=1745353331","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123361,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123361/movie480.mp4?t=1744315704","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123361/movie_max.mp4?t=1744315704"},"name":"Cubic Blitz Slice of Life Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app